	"Description": "This mod only works with the Tractor Mod.\n<br />\n<br />This takes away the Horse Clops and replaces it with a Humming engine (as best as I can muster anyways.. I'll work on that as time goes by)\n<br />\n<br />To use this you will need to:\n<br />\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Install [url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3043]Custom Music[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1726]PYTK[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1401]Tractor Mod[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*]Place this Mod in your Mods folder.&#92;\n<br />[*]Enjoy\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Sound file created by me (MissCoriel).\u00A0 You do [b]NOT[/b]\u00A0have permission to redistribute in any way.\n<br />\n<br />New SMAPI section that adds engine idle!!\n<br />\n<br />[size=5][b][size=5]Visit my\u00A0[/size][url=https://discord.gg/uSGNKNf]Cozy Apartment[/url][size=5]\u00A0if you have questions or interests.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]Have the desire to support me and my endeavors?\n<br />[url=https://www.patreon.com/MissCoriel]Support me through Patreon[/url]\n<br />My promise to you:\u00A0 My mods will always be free and open.\u00A0 Patreon will give you special Discord roles on my server and Exclusive access to my original music.\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />You do not need to ever pay money to access my mods/content or beta releases![/size][/b][/size]",
